==Evaluation==
; Pros
* [[Empathy]] is effective against attackers.
* [[Visions of Regret]] causes foes to take damage with each skill they use (from the [[Consulate Docks]] mission onward; or in [[Hard mode]]).
* Possesses two unconditional [[interrupt]]s.
* Can remove hexes (only after the Consulate Docks mission, or in Hard mode).
* Possesses a self-heal.

; Cons
* Henchmen do not prioritize interrupts effectively.

