==Notes==
* Odurra is seen wearing [[Mesmer Sunspear armor|Sunspear Armor]].

==Trivia==
*She is [[Erudine]]'s sister.
*Odurra's quote: "If you only have two coins left in the world, buy a loaf of bread with one and a rose with the other."<br>is taken from the Chinese proverb:"When you only have two pennies left in the world, buy a loaf of bread with one, and a lily with the other". 
*Odurra's quote: "Love is a fire. But whether it will warm your heart or burn down your house, you can never tell." <br>is actually a quote from film icon Joan Crawford.
*Odurra's quote: "Those who live by the sword get ensorcelled by those who don't."<br>is based on the Bible:"Those who live by the sword die by the sword.". 
* She was one of three henchmen in Nightfall who originally did not have an [[elite skill]] at level 20. This [[Talk:List of Nightfall henchmen#Elite skills for Odurra, Gehraz and Aidan in Nightfall|was intentional]], but was changed after the [[Game updates/20081113|13 November 2008]] game update. (The other 2 henchmen were [[Gehraz]] and [[Aidan]].) 
** Her henchman skills were updated again in the [[Game updates/20091022|22nd October 2009 update]]. Before this update, Odurra was labeled as an ''Illusion Henchman'', despite the fact that her build did not include any [[Illusion Magic]] skills.
*** This added [[Mistrust]] to her skills. 

